The server state should follow this structure:

- bans
    - users (list)
    - ids (list)
    - ips (list)

- whitelists
    - active (bool)
    - users (list)
    - ips (list)
    - ips (list)

- max players (int)

- users (dict)
    - id (str - key)
    - Player (Player obj - value)
        - username (str)
        - PlayerPacket
            - player anim weights (list[float])
            - player coords (Vector3)
            - player rot (Quaternion)
        - CappyPacket
            - cappy anim (str)
            - cappy coords (Vector3)
            - cappy rot (Quaternion)

